@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title MLMS - Configuration management: branches, CI and releases
start
:Create feature/<name> branch from main;
:Commit small changes\n("area: what changed", FR/CR id);
:Push branch;
partition "GitHub Actions CI (every push / PR / tag)" {
  :Install deps (g++, CMake, SQLite, libsodium, GoogleTest);
  :Configure + build (CMake);
  :Run 128 GoogleTest tests;
  :NFR-01 performance check (800 students);
  :cppcheck (fail on any finding);
  :clang-tidy (fail on any finding);
  :Coverage build, fail if business logic < 70%;
  :Lizard metrics + upload report;
}
if (All green?) then (yes)
  :Merge to main (--no-ff / pull request);
  :Tag release (v1.0, v1.1) + GitHub release;
else (no)
  :Fix on branch, log defect (e.g. D-10);
  :Push again;
endif
stop
@enduml
